OL,3,CSalmonella outbreak: How can you check
OL,4,Cyour eggs are safe?
OL,6,FFood poisoning outbreak "may be linked
OL,7,Fto eggs imported from outside the UK,"
OL,8,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOne person has died, and hundreds of
OL,12,Fothers have been affected by a
OL,13,Fsalmonella outbreak in the UK.
OL,15,FBabies and people as old as 90 have
OL,16,Falso been affected.
OL,18,FSalmonella generally causes a self-
OL,19,Flimiting gastroenteritis, with
OL,20,Fsymptoms including stomach cramps,
OL,21,Fdiarrhoea, vomiting, or fever.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
