OL,3,CSalmonella outbreak: How can you check
OL,4,Cyour eggs are safe?
OL,6,FMore than a third of people affected
OL,7,Fin the outbreak, 38%, were admitted to
OL,8,Fhospital, with two people developing
OL,9,Fpotentially life-threatening
OL,10,Fbloodstream infections.
OL,12,FSo how can you ensure your eggs are
OL,13,Fsafe?
OL,15,FAre eggs still safe to eat?
OL,17,FThe Food Standards Agency's (FSA)
OL,18,Fadvice around eating eggs remains the
OL,19,Fsame.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
