PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787080720
OL,3,CSalmonella outbreak: How can you check
OL,4,Cyour eggs are safe?
OL,6,FShe added that the advice does not
OL,7,Fapply to those who are "severely
OL,8,Fimmunocompromised and require
OL,9,Fmedically supervised diets".
OL,11,F"We continue to advise people who are
OL,12,Fhandling eggs, eggshells or egg
OL,13,Fpackaging to always wash their hands
OL,14,Fthoroughly with warm water and soap
OL,15,Fand dry them properly afterwards," she
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FWhat are the symptoms of salmonella?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
