OL,3,CSalmonella outbreak: How can you check
OL,4,Cyour eggs are safe?
OL,6,F"Anyone who is concerned about
OL,7,Fsymptoms should contact their GP or
OL,8,Fout-of-hours service in the first
OL,9,Finstance," Hannah Charles, lead
OL,10,Fepidemiologist for gastrointestinal
OL,11,Finfections at UKHSA, added.
OL,13,FHow can you prevent its spread?
OL,15,FMs Charles explained that there are
OL,16,Fseveral simple steps to help prevent
OL,17,Fthe spread of salmonella.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
