OL,3,CSalmonella outbreak: How can you check
OL,4,Cyour eggs are safe?
OL,6,FThese include washing your hands
OL,7,Fthoroughly after using the bathroom
OL,8,Fand before preparing and handling
OL,9,Ffood, cooking food thoroughly, and, if
OL,10,Fyou have any symptoms, avoiding
OL,11,Fhandling food for others where
OL,12,Fpossible.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
